  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help us counter LGBTQ+ discrimination in Japan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We are NIJIIRO DIVERSITY, a nonprofit working with the LGBTQ community, their families and allies. We aim to create an inclusive society where future generations can live true to their sexual orientations, gender identities and gender expressions. Our efforts include producing local and nationwide research, community support, and seminars occurring at corporations of various sizes, governmental institutions and schools. Our research visualizes the voices, experiences and needs of the community.</narrative>
  </description>
